WEBVTT

00:05:59.381 --> 00:06:02.662
improvised feelings of critical thought.

00:06:02.686 --> 00:06:06.084
Our social movements should be like jazz:

00:06:06.108 --> 00:06:08.914
encouraging active participation,

00:06:08.938 --> 00:06:10.181
listening,

00:06:10.205 --> 00:06:11.701
spontaneity and freedom.

00:06:11.725 --> 00:06:14.106
What people see as a party ...

00:06:14.130 --> 00:06:16.625
PA: is actually a movement meeting.

00:06:16.649 --> 00:06:18.968
See, we aren't all protest and pain.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:20.997
Here's a place to be loved,

00:06:21.021 --> 00:06:22.935
to be felt, to be heard,

00:06:22.959 --> 00:06:26.320
and where we prepare
for the most pressing political issues

00:06:26.344 --> 00:06:27.768
in our neighborhoods.

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:30.931
See, laws never change culture,